[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/d3Ex22/TCGCardShopSimulator-Mods/main/EPLVariableBoosterSize/NexusMods/header_1400x400.jpg[/img]

[size=5][b][color=#E0B13A]Boosters of any size for Enhanced Prefab Loader card sets.[/color][/b][/size]
[size=3][color=#C9C9C9]Build your boosters like the real ones, 11 cards, 10 cards or 4, with a rarity table per slot, and open them in the game as usual.[/color][/size]

[url=https://github.com/d3Ex22/TCGCardShopSimulator-Mods/tree/main/EPLVariableBoosterSize][img]https://img.shields.io/badge/source-GitHub-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white[/img][/url] [img]https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.2.0-B3402E?style=for-the-badge[/img] [img]https://img.shields.io/badge/BepInEx-5.4.23-3E7B3A?style=for-the-badge[/img] [img]https://img.shields.io/badge/AI--made-Claude-E0B13A?style=for-the-badge[/img][/center]

[line]

[size=5][b][color=#E0B13A]Description[/color][/b][/size]

[size=3][b]Enhanced Prefab Loader[/b] builds a card pack from slots, [b]Slot1 to Slot7[/b], each with its rarity chances, and the game's opening is made for exactly 7 cards. This extension lifts both limits for the packs that ask for it:

[list]
[*][b]Any number of slots[/b]: Slot8, Slot9 and beyond, ranges such as Slot1-5, or fewer than 7. One card per slot, drawn like EPL's own packs.
[*][b]The opening follows the pack[/b]: the game's card by card reveal goes on to the last card.
[*][b]Final screen[/b]: two rows fitted to your screen for more than 7 cards, whatever its resolution or shape, and one row across the screen for fewer.
[*][b]God packs[/b] get the pack's size too.
[*][b]Other packs are untouched[/b]: the game's packs and every other EPL pack open exactly as before.
[*][b]MyCurio Pokémon sets[/b]: the [b]MyCurio Suite[/b], a separate download, gives every MyCurio booster its real size and pull rates.
[/list][/size]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/d3Ex22/TCGCardShopSimulator-Mods/main/EPLVariableBoosterSize/NexusMods/main_1920x1080.jpg[/img][/center]

[size=3]On its own, the mod changes no pack: a pack gets its size from a card set mod, from a pack file such as the MyCurio Suite, or from a file of your own.[/size]

[line]

[size=5][b][color=#E0B13A]Giving a pack another size[/color][/b][/size]

[size=4][b][color=#E9DCB5]In the set's EPL JSON[/color][/b][/size]
[size=3]Write the slots in the pack's [b]SlotWeights[/b]. The set then requires EPL Variable Booster Size.
[code]"SlotWeights": {
  "Slot1-7":  { "Common": 100 },
  "Slot8-10": { "Uncommon": 100 },
  "Slot11":   { "Rare": 70, "Holo Rare": 30 }
}[/code][/size]

[size=4][b][color=#E9DCB5]In a pack file[/color][/b][/size]
[size=3]Keep the set's EPL JSON at 7 slots and ship a [b]anything.packslots.json[/b] file anywhere under [i]BepInEx/plugins[/i], one entry per pack ItemType. Without EPL Variable Booster Size the file is simply ignored, so a card set mod stays playable for everyone.
[code]{
  "sviPack": {
    "SlotWeights": {                    // required: one card per slot
      "Slot1-4": { "Common ": 100 },
      "Slot5-7": { "Uncommon ": 100 },
      "Slot8":   { "Common Reverse Holofoil": 49.3, "Uncommon Reverse Holofoil": 28.2, "Rare Reverse Holofoil": 9.9 },
      "Slot9":   { "Common Reverse Holofoil": 49.3, "Illustration Rare": 5.6, "Special Illustration Rare": 2.2, "Hyper Rare": 1.9 },
      "Slot10":  { "Rare Holofoil": 79.7, "Double Rare": 13.8, "Ultra Rare": 6.6 }
    },
    "CanHaveDuplicates": false,         // optional: the same card twice in a pack
    "PriceMultiplier": 1.4,             // optional: price of the pack and its boxes, existing saves included
    "CanHaveGodPacks": true,            // optional: god packs on or off
    "GodPackPercentage": 0.0002,        // optional: chance of a god pack
    "GodWeights": {                     // optional: god pack rarities, every card is drawn from them
      "Special Illustration Rare": 70,
      "★_Special Illustration Rare": 30
    }
  }
}[/code]
[list]
[*]Slot keys are [i]SlotN[/i], ranges [i]SlotA-B[/i] or lists [i]Slot1, Slot2[/i]. Rarity names are the set's own, and weights are relative chances.
[*]Optional fields fall back to the pack's own settings.
[*]A pack file wins over the set's JSON. Keys starting with _ and // comments are ignored.
[*]Files are read when the game starts. The BepInEx log lists every pack changed and why one was skipped.
[/list][/size]

[line]

[size=5][b][color=#E0B13A]Settings[/color][/b][/size]

[size=3][i]BepInEx/config/gab.tcgshop.eplvariableboostersize.cfg[/i], also available in game through the Configuration Manager:
[list]
[*][b]CardScale[/b] (0.75): card size on the final screen of a pack of more than 7 cards. Cards shrink further when the rows do not fit.
[*][b]RowSpacing[/b] (0.73): distance between the two rows, in card heights.
[/list][/size]

[line]

[size=5][b][color=#E0B13A]Installation[/color][/b][/size]

[size=3][list=1]
[*]Install [b]BepInEx 5.4.23[/b] and [b]Enhanced Prefab Loader[/b] 6.8.0 or newer.
[*]Install with your mod manager, or put [i]EPLVariableBoosterSize.dll[/i] in [i]BepInEx/plugins/EPLVariableBoosterSize/[/i].
[/list][/size]

[line]

[size=2][color=#9A9A9A][b]AI-made.[/b] This mod was written by an AI (Claude). I'm a developer, but I did not review its code: I made it simply to be able to play and enjoy the game. It is shared as is; use it at your own risk.[/color][/size]

[line]

